   {
    "primary": {
     "title": [
      {
       "type": "heading2",
       "text": "Layout grid",
       "spans": []
      }
     ],
     "ingress_title": [],
     "body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The Aalto design system uses a 12-column layout grid to help structure and organise content in a responsive way across various screen sizes. From tablets and up, all breakpoints follow this standard grid. On smaller mobile phone screens, a 2-column layout is utilized instead.",
       "spans": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "While it's possible for designers to place elements outside of the grid columns, it is recommended to align content in relation to the columns for consistency and harmony between different content modules.",
       "spans": []
      }
     ],
